    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Fantasy Idle is an idle RPG with unique class-based gameplay and hundreds of achievements and secrets to find. Level up by farming, battling, and researching while buying items and perks, then rebirth to find newfound power! Embark on a journey of fantasy and mystery to unravel your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459200/extras/5aa60998dd1acd7e712ee6a0c5a0e534.avif?t=1755540305\" alt=\"Class choices\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Feature Rich RPG In An Idle Package</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class-based Gameplay.</strong> Play a variety of fantasy archetypes each with unique gameplay, including the Farmhand, Squire, and Researcher. No need to choose - you get to play them all! Level up to spend perk points and earn gold to buy shop items, all unique to each class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Expanding Narrative and World.</strong> Discover your true calling and defend against an overarching threat to your world.\u00a0Watch the world expand, evolve and change as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements.</strong> Unlock hundreds of achievements that power you up even further. Can you find  all the secret ones? Hint: You may want to check out the credits. ;)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Pay-To-Win Mechanics, Microtransactions, or Ads.</strong> Everyone plays with the same rules and same mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459200/extras/320bfd7dcdcaa37ff00884018dc1c61f.poster.avif?t=1755540305\" aria-label=\"Farmhand farming example\" width=632 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459200/extras/320bfd7dcdcaa37ff00884018dc1c61f.webm?t=1755540305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459200/extras/320bfd7dcdcaa37ff00884018dc1c61f.mp4?t=1755540305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Game For Everyone</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls.</strong>\u00a0Play the entire game by using a mouse or touch screen. Controls are kept simple for improved accessibility and easy pick up &amp; play sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Idle Right From the Start.</strong> No need to play for hours to unlock idle mechanics. Enjoy offline progression and passive gains mere minutes into starting the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge or Chill.</strong> Want a challenge? Optimize your playthrough and track your time against your friends. Want a chill experience? No need to worry - you will always be able to progress.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Fantasy Idle is an idle RPG with unique class-based gameplay and hundreds of achievements and secrets to find. Level up by farming, battling, and researching while buying items and perks, then rebirth to find newfound power! Embark on a journey of fantasy and mystery to unravel your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459200/extras/5aa60998dd1acd7e712ee6a0c5a0e534.avif?t=1755540305\" alt=\"Class choices\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Feature Rich RPG In An Idle Package</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class-based Gameplay.</strong> Play a variety of fantasy archetypes each with unique gameplay, including the Farmhand, Squire, and Researcher. No need to choose - you get to play them all! Level up to spend perk points and earn gold to buy shop items, all unique to each class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Expanding Narrative and World.</strong> Discover your true calling and defend against an overarching threat to your world.\u00a0Watch the world expand, evolve and change as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements.</strong> Unlock hundreds of achievements that power you up even further. Can you find  all the secret ones? Hint: You may want to check out the credits. ;)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Pay-To-Win Mechanics, Microtransactions, or Ads.</strong> Everyone plays with the same rules and same mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459200/extras/320bfd7dcdcaa37ff00884018dc1c61f.poster.avif?t=1755540305\" aria-label=\"Farmhand farming example\" width=632 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459200/extras/320bfd7dcdcaa37ff00884018dc1c61f.webm?t=1755540305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459200/extras/320bfd7dcdcaa37ff00884018dc1c61f.mp4?t=1755540305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Game For Everyone</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls.</strong>\u00a0Play the entire game by using a mouse or touch screen. Controls are kept simple for improved accessibility and easy pick up &amp; play sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Idle Right From the Start.</strong> No need to play for hours to unlock idle mechanics. Enjoy offline progression and passive gains mere minutes into starting the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge or Chill.</strong> Want a challenge? Optimize your playthrough and track your time against your friends. Want a chill experience? No need to worry - you will always be able to progress.</p></li></ul>",
